     "type": "key",
     "style": "definition",
     "title": "Units of time",
     "md": "1 minute = 60 seconds. 1 hour = 60 minutes. 1 day = 24 hours. 1 week = 7 days. 1 year = 12 months = 52 weeks (about). The **short hand** shows hours, the **long hand** shows minutes. When the long hand is at 9 it is **quarter to**; at 3 it is **quarter past**; at 6 it is **half past**."
